\title{tidypm: Tidy Tools for Multi-Asset Portfolio Management}
\description{
Tools for multi-asset portfolio management that stand beside 'PortfolioAnalytics' rather than wrapping it. Included are a tibble interface to the wide return matrices it expects, reproducible access to public data through a pinned cutoff date and a local cache, portfolio universes and screens, total returns for constant-maturity government and credit bonds built from yields, a strategy register with an out-of-sample backtest that charges trading costs by asset class, and per-period diagnostics reporting which dates of a rolling optimization produced a portfolio and what went wrong at the others. A simulated multi-asset market is shipped with the package so that every example runs offline. Companion package to the book "Tidy Asset Allocation in R".
}
